\details{
The expected transmissions (\eqn{ET^*}) and non-transmissions (\eqn{ENT^*}) are computed as:

\deqn{
ET^* = 2N^* \left[
  \pi \left( \frac{D(p_+ - \theta_1)C}{\phi_1} + p_d p_+ \right)
  + (1 - \pi)\left( \frac{D(p_+ - 0.5)C}{\phi_1} + p_d p_+ \right)
\right]
