\eqn{2N^*} gives the corresponding \eqn{g_T^*} and \eqn{g_{NT}^*}
probabilities. The canonical \code{heter_rate} used by \code{tdt_power()}
and \code{tdt_mssn()} equals \eqn{1-\pi}.
